# health v2.10 -- WARNING. A daily vital reading written the way health v2.9
# wrote it: a display date and a value, no interval, no statistic, no zone.
#
# This is the ratchet the round promises, stated as a test: data that validated
# under v2.9 is NOTICED under v2.10 (health:AggregateReadingShape reports the
# missing interval and statistic at sh:Warning) and is NOT rejected. If a later
# shapes release raises any of these to sh:Violation before existing pods have
# been rewritten, this fixture fails.
#
# Fully synthetic.

@prefix cascade: <https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/core/v1#> .
@prefix health: <https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/health/v1#> .
@prefix loinc: <http://loinc.org/rdf#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<urn:uuid:0b7a1c00-0020-4000-8000-000000000001> a health:DailyVitalReading ;
    health:date "2031-03-08T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    health:value "61"^^xsd:double ;
    health:unit "bpm" ;
    cascade:sampleCount 142 ;
    cascade:loincCode loinc:40443-4 ;
    cascade:dataProvenance cascade:DeviceGenerated .
